          "documentation": "Количество по артикулу и конкретному источнику импорта.\n\nИмя в БД: ff_import_snapshots\nПервичный ключ: id\nUNIQUE (store_slug, fulfillment, marketplace, source_type, source_key, article)\n\n\nОпределение SQLite:\nCREATE TABLE ff_import_snapshots (\n\tid INTEGER NOT NULL, \n\tstore_slug VARCHAR NOT NULL, \n\tfulfillment VARCHAR NOT NULL, \n\tmarketplace VARCHAR NOT NULL, \n\tsource_type VARCHAR NOT NULL, \n\tsource_key VARCHAR NOT NULL, \n\tarticle VARCHAR NOT NULL, \n\tquantity INTEGER DEFAULT '0' NOT NULL, \n\tupdated_at VARCHAR NOT NULL, \n\tPRIMARY KEY (id), \n\tUNIQUE (store_slug, fulfillment, marketplace, source_type, source_key, article)\n);",
